<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch post Dfl 2.9 billion March trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Dutch post Dfl 2.9 billion March trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch trade surplus widened to a provisional 2.9 billion guilders in March 1997 from 2.5 billion in February, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.  </p>
<p>DUTCH TRADE BALANCE    March 97	Febr 97	March 96</p>
<p> exports		    31.0	   29.1	   29.9</p>
<p> imports		    28.1	   26.6	   26.2</p>
<p> trade balance	    +2.9	   +2.5	   +3.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Merchandise trade in billions of guilders.</p>
</text>
